{
  "comments": [
    {
      "address": "C000H",
      "source": "hbf",
      "text": "MOPS signature. C004H is the name length 04H and C005H-C008H is the card name DISK. The same nine bytes open every HBF ROM page."
    },
    {
      "address": "C009H",
      "source": "hbf",
      "text": "Two constant bytes, 6FH DBH, present on every page and not part of the DISK name."
    },
    {
      "address": "C00BH",
      "source": "hbf",
      "text": "Little-endian initializer. EXT_INIT reads (C00BH) and calls it through FFF9H while this page is mapped. The target is C21CH."
    },
    {
      "address": "C00DH",
      "source": "hbf",
      "text": "Counted function table. The count byte is 0CH, so function numbers 0 through 0BH are valid. Each entry is a little-endian address."
    },
    {
      "address": "C00EH",
      "source": "hbf",
      "text": "Function 0 and the card IRQ vector. The target DBC1H is in HBF private RAM at D000H-DFFFH."
    },
